    description: "WI-mafik Level 1b child (multi-gap). (1) `alias String, as: S` + `S.upcase(...)` preserves the alias `S` rather than resolving to `String` (dst emitted: `elixir:S:0-0:upcase:unresolved`). (2) `import Enum, only: [count: 1]` + bare `count(...)` emits no calls edge at all. Repro in polyglot fixture::elixir. Fix lives in packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src/hypergumbo_lang_mainstream/elixir.py — alias resolution + import-only name tracking. Acceptance: remove xfail_reason for elixir in the polyglot fixture without other test changes."  # 2c40
